      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-14T19:19:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Afaik I have to copy the `c.arguments()[0]` since `IndexExpression` expects ownership over the unique ptr and we only have const access to the argument array. \n\nI\u0027m a bit confused on the first paragraph on what you mean by \"hard-coded set of appends\". If you mean manually appending the strings together, we would still need the `FieldAccess` expression since that may be different per backend (e.g some use . or -\u003e). I do agree that the expression creation is essentially the same and that logic could be encapsulated elsewhere, though when writing this I didn\u0027t know if there was a good spot for that.",
